    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1374">

                <pb facs="1346" n="1336" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1336"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">195.91/9–949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Taipei</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Macdonald</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-13T17:00:00-04:00">September 13,
                            1949—5 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>308. Re telCan 661 Sept 9, rptd Taipei 300, Nanking 1078, Shanghai 1839. As of
                    possible value expediting decision this question by Nat Govt authorities pls
                    bring attn Chen Cheng<anchor n="58" xml:id="d1374-f1"/> situation outlined ref
                    and previous tels, together with APL counter-proposal and our view thereof.
                    Stress strong demand Amers for evacuation and fact that US Govt personnel being
                    brought out as result reduction offices Commie-held China. Within ur discretion
                    also approach K. C. Wu<anchor n="59" xml:id="d1374-f2"/> along foregoing lines,
                    in view possibility he may be able reach ear of Gimo.<anchor n="60"
                        xml:id="d1374-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1374-f1" n="58" xml:id="d1374-f1-content">
                <p>Governor of Taiwan (Formosa).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1374-f2" n="59" xml:id="d1374-f2-content">
                <p>Former Mayor of Shanghai.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1374-f3" n="60" xml:id="d1374-f3-content">
                <p>Generalissimo Chiang Kai-shek, with headquarters on Taiwan.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
